  WrittenDialogue: "Sorry that took a while. They needed me to twist my spine 120 degrees.\nAnd I know I said we were going out but during the shoot a producer gave me a script for an audition tonight.\nI really wanna have fun but this is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity!\nLike, me as a real actor with awards and political opinions?\nThat sounds amazing! But I would need to get some political opinions first.\nHow did people feel about 9/11? Like are we over that?\nWhatever, but yeah should I do it?"
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY"
